        "features": [
          "The Next Generation Wallet: This minimalist wallet for men gives you easier access to your cards and comes with built in rfid data protection to prevent wireless theft. Forget about rummaging through a bifold wallet, by using our patented card ejection mechanism, you can instantly pop out your cards at the click of a button.",
          "Sustainable Materials: The Ekster Parliament leather wallet is a men’s metal trigger wallet handcrafted from premium top-grain leather, tanned under silver-rated Lwg-certified protocols, and 6063 T5 Aluminium. Durably designed for daily use, this mens wallet slim design requires minimal upkeep to for a lifetime of use.",
          "Slim Storage: Store up to 10+ cards, fitting 4-6 in the data protected cardholder while keeping a slim profile. You can also store extras in the cash strap and additional hidden pockets. The Parliament minimalist wallet for men is compact and slim without sacrificing storage space.",
          "Make It Unloseable: Perfectly fits the Ekster Tracker Card to make sure you never lose your wallet again. Misplaced or lost your Ekster? Ring it from your phone or see where you last had it on a map. Tracking device is sold separately and works with any model; the Ekster Parliament, Ekster Aluminum Cardholder or Ekster Senate mens wallets.",
          "Our Promise: We create better gear for life on the move and your satisfaction is our top priority; if we don’t meet your expectations just send it back. Depending on the number of cards and bills stored in the wallet, the flap may not close entirely in the first weeks of use. After 1-2 weeks of usage, your wallet will take the natural shape of your pocket and will remain closed naturally."
        ]
